# The generated catalogs are gzip streams, and CI asserts their DECOMPRESSED CONTENTS
# against their generators (`guides-transform.py --check` — the container is not part of
# the claim, trap 74). Git's own binary sniffing has always got these right, but "has
# always" is not a guarantee to rest on: one line-ending conversion on checkout and the
# stream no longer decompresses at all.
*.gz binary
